## Lossy conversions (2)

- `createuser.flux.md`: client.exit. Response handler API not available in Fluxwire
- `createuser.flux.md`: dynamic variable `{{$...}}`. Built-in dynamic variables such as `$uuid` and `$timestamp` are not variables in Fluxwire; set them in a `pre` script
